### Cliente REST: extensión "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) en VS Code / Codespaces.
### Cambia @host si tu puerto no es 8080.
@host = http://localhost:8080
### En modo docker (perfil 'docker') el lab exige clave: dispatcher = leer y escribir; viewer = solo leer.
@apiKey = lab-dev-dispatcher-key

### Salud
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Flota
GET {{host}}/api/robots
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Plano del almacén
GET {{host}}/api/routes/grid
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Ruta A* de (0,0) a (11,7)
GET {{host}}/api/routes?fromX=0&fromY=0&toX=11&toY=7
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Ruta a una celda bloqueada -> 422
GET {{host}}/api/routes?fromX=0&fromY=0&toX=1&toY=1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Pedidos paginados (con enlaces HATEOAS)
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=0&size=2
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Filtrar por estado
GET {{host}}/api/orders?status=CREATED
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Crear pedido
POST {{host}}/api/orders
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer": "Tiendas Tía Cumbayá", "destX": 10, "destY": 5 }

### Validación -> 400 (cliente vacío)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer": "", "destX": 3, "destY": 0 }

### Despachar el pedido 1 (asigna AMR, calcula ruta y ETA)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/1/dispatch
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Despachar otra vez -> 409 (transición ilegal)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/1/dispatch
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Pasar a IN_TRANSIT (en modo docker lo hace solo el consumidor de RabbitMQ)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/1/transitions
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "IN_TRANSIT" }

### Entregar
POST {{host}}/api/orders/1/transitions
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "DELIVERED" }

### Saltarse estados -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/orders/2/transitions
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "DELIVERED" }

### Pedido con transportista lento (WireMock tarda 5 s; el cliente corta a los 2 s y degrada)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "LP-SLOW1", "customer": "Prueba timeout", "destX": 5, "destY": 3 }

###
POST {{host}}/api/orders/4/dispatch
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Cargar batería del robot 5
POST {{host}}/api/robots/5/charge
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Métricas Prometheus
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Inventario / reposición / packing
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stock?belowMin=true

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stock/suggestions

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchase-orders
Idempotency-Key: po-demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"SKU-01","qty":40,"proposedBy":"estudiante"}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchase-orders/1/approve
X-Approver: gerente

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchase-orders/1/receive

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/packing-jobs
Idempotency-Key: pack-demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderCode":"LP-DEMO01","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-01","qty":2},{"sku":"SKU-04","qty":3}]}
